      "title": "Letterboxd review of Gladiator",
      "snippet": "[Letterboxd Review of \"Gladiator\"] Anger is the weakness.All you mafks who ironically say \"James was always cool\", have not seen this film. Can't remember the last time I've predicted 99% of a movie's plot, shot for shot, and still feel this amazing. ARE YOU NOT ENTERTAINED?!? Hehehehehe.With a coincidental refresher on Rocky a few weeks ago, Gladiator feels like an extension of this universe only updated for 15 years later, has street boxing, and perhaps makes more commentary on coming out on top despite personal disadvantages. Dennehy is evil incarnate and in FINAL BOSS mode, exploiting every single young man that walks throu",
